      <tr><td bgcolor="#f0eaf9" width="14"> </td><td align="left"><b>measurement</b></td><td align="left">writes a stamped artifact, never a claim</td></tr>
      <tr><td bgcolor="#e3f4f4" width="14"> </td><td align="left"><b>agent</b></td><td align="left">answers from the release, refuses past it</td></tr>
      <tr><td colspan="3" align="left"><font point-size="7.5" color="#555555">12 of 13 declared layers are in this release (absent: curated). Merge order is LAYER_PRECEDENCE: spine → host → vhppi → orcs → curated → chembl → selectivity → gtop → hosttargets → similarity → ncats → indications → folds.</font></td></tr>
    </table>>];
  A_a -> key [style=invis, weight=10];
